# ⛔ LOAD-BEARING, AND IT IS HALF OF A PAIR. Added 3 September 2026.
#
# `index.php` in here makes /api/enquiry a real DIRECTORY, so mod_dir 301s the
# slash-less form. A browser answering a 301 re-issues the request as a GET and
# DROPS THE BODY, so every form on the site posted its enquiry into a redirect
# and the endpoint reported being called with the wrong method. That is the
# "This endpoint takes a POST." the client photographed.
#
# The other half is `RewriteRule ^api/enquiry/?$ /api/enquiry/index.php [L]` in
# the ROOT .htaccess, above rule 0. NEITHER HALF WORKS ALONE:
#   - the rewrite alone still 301s, because mod_dir's fixup runs first;
#   - this alone 404s, because mod_dir will not serve a DirectoryIndex for the
#     slash-less form once the slash is off. That is the 2 Sep /api/articles
#     result, and it is why this file must never be uploaded on its own.
#
# Same pairing as public/articles/.htaccess, for the same reason.
DirectorySlash Off
